OL,3,GNEWSAPetition for couple in Iran jail
OL,4,Asent to government
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe son of a British couple detained in
OL,7,FIran has given the government a
OL,8,Fpetition with more than 100,000
OL,9,Fsignatures asking it to do "everything
OL,10,Fin its power" to secure their freedom.
OL,12,FLindsay and Craig Foreman, from East
OL,13,FSussex, were arrested in January 2025
OL,14,Fwhile passing through the country on a
OL,15,Fmotorbike trip from Europe to
OL,16,FAustralia. They were sentenced to 10
OL,17,Fyears in jail on espionage charges in
OL,18,FFebruary, which they deny.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
